graph TD
  subgraph Runtime
    PLAT[Platform / server.js, api/index.js]
    DATA[(Data layer db.js / driver.js)]
  end
  subgraph Instance_Features[Instance features]
    IDN[Identity & access]
    MEM[Member self-service]
    BKG[Booking engine]
    ADM[Instance admin]
    DOC[Vehicle documents]
  end
  subgraph Shared_Services[Shared services]
    NOTIF[Mail + Jobs]
    BRAND[Branding / Storage / Views]
  end
  subgraph Control_Plane[Multi-tenant control plane]
    CONS[Master console master.js + routes/master.js]
    PROV[Provisioning provision.js + new-client.js]
    MAPI[Mgmt API routes/manage.js]
  end
  EXT[(Turso / Vercel APIs)]

  PLAT --> IDN & MEM & BKG & ADM & DOC & MAPI
  PLAT -. config.master / masterConsole .-> CONS
  PLAT -->|startJobs / cron| NOTIF
  PLAT -->|suspendedGate| MAPI
  IDN --> DATA & BRAND & NOTIF
  MEM --> IDN & DOC & BRAND & DATA
  BKG --> DATA & NOTIF
  ADM --> BKG & IDN & DOC & BRAND & NOTIF & DATA
  DOC --> BRAND & DATA
  NOTIF --> BKG & BRAND & DATA
  BRAND --> DATA
  MAPI --> IDN & BRAND & NOTIF & DATA
  CONS --> PROV & IDN & ADM & NOTIF & DATA
  CONS ==>|HTTPS Bearer MANAGE_TOKEN| MAPI
  PROV --> EXT
